  "description": "Backend-neutral vector scene intermediate representation (IR) for the IHO S-100 portrayal pipeline: VectorScene and the PaintOp hierarchy (point/line/area/pattern/text), VectorSceneBuilder, ColorResolver, ScaleVisibility, and WebMercator projection. Depends only on EncDotNet.S100.Core and EncDotNet.S100.Portrayals — no SkiaSharp, Mapsui, or GUI framework — so any rendering backend can consume the same resolved scene. Pairs with EncDotNet.S100.Renderers.Skia for headless rasterisation without the EncDotNet.S100 facade.",
